::  modules/pond/glow/gate-puddle-exec.glow -- Capability verb gate!
/!  16384
|%
++  gate-puddle-exec
  |=  [has-metachar=@ud verb-code=@ud]                  ::  0=clean, 1..4=ok
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  approved verb
  ~|  'puddle-shell-metachar-refused'                   ::  zero /bin/sh -c!
  ?>  (eql has-metachar 0)                              ::  no ; | & $ `
  ~|  'puddle-verb-not-allowlisted'                     ::  1..4 capability
  ?>  &(gte(verb-code 1) lte(verb-code 4))
  verb-code
--
